From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mbt28 <btekbas@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] arm: dts: lctech-pi: theme for the configuration editor

`cedit run` reads its theme from /bootstd/cedit-theme and warns "No
theme found" without one. Its default title margin of 0 puts each
setting's value right after the longest title, so the two run into each
other. Add the node with a 32-pixel margin.

U-Boot includes only the first matching -u-boot.dtsi, so the board file
includes sunxi-u-boot.dtsi itself.

Signed-off-by: mbt28 <btekbas@gmail.com>
---
--- a/arch/arm/dts/suniv-f1c200s-lctech-pi-u-boot.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm/dts/suniv-f1c200s-lctech-pi-u-boot.dtsi
@@ -0,0 +1,20 @@
+// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0+
+/*
+ * U-Boot additions for the Lctech Pi F1C200s. Only the first matching
+ * -u-boot.dtsi is included, so this one pulls in the sunxi one itself.
+ */
+
+#include "sunxi-u-boot.dtsi"
+
+/ {
+	bootstd {
+		/*
+		 * Theme for the boot settings form (cedit). The value column
+		 * starts menu-title-margin-x pixels after the longest title;
+		 * the default of 0 makes the two touch.
+		 */
+		cedit-theme {
+			menu-title-margin-x = <32>;
+		};
+	};
+};
